      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The moonkin is a 9th-level spellcaster. Its spell casting ability is Wisdom (spell save DC 14, +6 to hit with spell attacks). The moonkin has the following druid spells prepared: Cantrips (at will) : <em>druidcraft, resistance, ✦ solar wrath</em> 1st level (4 slots): <em>healing word, entangle, faerie fire, ✦ starfire</em> 2nd level (3 slots): <em>barkskin, ✦ cyclone, moonbeam</em> 3rd level (3 slots): <em>mass healing word, plant growth, ✦ starsurge</em> 4th level (3 slots): <em>grasping vine, guardian of nature</em>, 5th level (1 slot): <em>wrath of nature</em></p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
